+## Status
+- Merge 1/3 done: `exp/vectorized-join` merged (conflict: PROGRESS.md only; its EXPERIMENT.md/PROGRESS.md moved to docs/vectorized-join-*). `cargo check --all-targets` clean.
+- Noted from reading the source EXPERIMENT.mds: `AdjacencyPattern` (sparse-matrix) will not implement `BatchPattern`, so `BatchedJoinEngine::supports` will reject any query containing a ref triple pattern and silently fall back to the row engine. Needs per-query engine instrumentation to confirm/report.
+- Columnar's batch path composes for free: `TriplePattern::as_batch` reaches storage via the same `create_iterator`/`estimate_count` helpers columnar patches.
 
